@dalexeev thank you for mentioning those two. Looking at #99778 , it seems like the implementation is that of a readonly variable, not an immutable one. Please correct me if i'm wrong

That PR also seems to be inactive. On the other hand, the proposal was active recently, and the community was found to be in favor of `readonly` as nomenclature. 
@JackErb are you still planning on working on the feature? If not, this PR would accomplish the same thing.
The implementation is very different, but that seems to be due to yours using a new keyword whereas mine uses an annotation (which makes life easier I believe)
